---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Us — True Online Compass"
	description="About True Online Compass — a free, privacy-first online compass built in the browser. No install, no trackers, no accounts. Live heading, Qibla, bearing, and sun position."
	path="/en/about/"
	keywords="about online compass, online compass tool, free online compass, True Online Compass"
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24">
		<p class="eyebrow">about us</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 text-display-lg text-ink">The compass the internet deserves.</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 text-body-lg text-body">
			We build free, browser-based tools that respect your privacy. True Online Compass is a
			fast, True Online Compass that runs entirely on your device — nothing to install,
			nothing to track.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-body">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink mb-3">Why we built it</h2>
				<p class="leading-7">
					Most "online compass" sites are cluttered with ads, demand app downloads, or send your
					location to a server before showing you anything. We wanted a free online compass tool
					that is genuinely useful: a live 360° dial powered by your phone's real sensors,
					corrected against the World Magnetic Model, with everything computed locally in the
					browser.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-7">
					So we built one — a single page that turns your phone into a precision compass in
					seconds, plus the tools around it that travellers, students, and builders actually
					need: GPS coordinates, a Qibla finder, a bearing calculator, and sun position.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink mb-3">What we value</h2>
				<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
					<div class="card-soft p-5">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1">Privacy by default</p>
						<p class="text-sm leading-6">No accounts, no trackers, no analytics, no backend. Your location never leaves your device.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="card-soft p-5">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1">Accuracy matters</p>
						<p class="text-sm leading-6">True north corrected by magnetic declination, tilt-compensated heading, and live accuracy feedback.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="card-soft p-5">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1">Free forever</p>
						<p class="text-sm leading-6">No paywalls, no premium tiers. Every tool is free and always will be.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="card-soft p-5">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1">Works everywhere</p>
						<p class="text-sm leading-6">Chrome, Safari, and Firefox on iOS and Android — in your browser, on any modern phone.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink mb-3">Our toolkit</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-7">
					<li>
						<a href="/en/compass/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">Online compass</a> — live heading with true and magnetic north
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/en/location/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">GPS location</a> — coordinates in decimal and DMS
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/en/qibla/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">Qibla finder</a> — direction to the Kaaba from your location
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/en/bearing/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">Bearing calculator</a> — direction and distance between two points
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="/en/sun/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">Sun position</a> — azimuth, elevation, sunrise, and sunset
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink mb-3">Get in touch</h2>
				<p class="leading-7">
					Questions, feedback, or ideas? We read everything — reach us via the
					<a href="/en/contact/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">contact page</a>,
					or read the
					<a href="/en/privacy/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">privacy policy</a>
					and
					<a href="/en/terms/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">terms &amp; conditions</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
